        <activityName xml:lang="en">Retention aids, in paper production, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Retention aids, in paper production, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of retention aids. Very large uncertainty of the process data due to the weak data on the process.;
UUID: 3da5aaa6-39b8-3fbd-a35d-66914c85c67a
Raw material approximated by acrylic acid; estimation of energy demand and infrastructure of the plant (approximation). Further inputs, solid wastes and emissions omitted.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: data represents a rough estimation of the production process
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Process data based on estimation. Energy demand based on approximation from large chemical plant. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3da5aaa6-39b8-3fbd-a35d-66914c85c67a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
